{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"c837f467a020938eec4ea2e106f9662e4fc510f07ebe6c3afbf22ab35e3647fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿宣布以色列受懲罰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，不要像外邦人歡喜快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你行邪淫離棄你的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各穀場上如妓女喜愛賞賜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穀場和酒醡都不夠以色列人使用；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新酒也必缺乏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必不得住耶和華的地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮卻要歸回埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必在亞述吃不潔淨的食物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必不得向耶和華奠酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即便奠酒也不蒙悅納。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的祭物必如居喪者的食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡吃的必被玷污；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他們的食物只為自己的口腹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不奉入耶和華的殿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大會的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到耶和華的節期，你們怎樣行呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，他們逃避災難；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人必收殮他們的屍首，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩弗人必葬埋他們的骸骨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們用銀子做的美物上必長蒺藜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的帳棚中必生荊棘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"以色列人必知道降罰的日子臨近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報應的時候來到。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"民說：作先知的是愚昧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受靈感的是狂妄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"皆因他們多多作孽，大懷怨恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮曾作我上帝守望的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於先知，在他一切的道上作為捕鳥人的網羅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他上帝的家中懷怨恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮深深地敗壞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如在基比亞的日子一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必記念他們的罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追討他們的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的罪及其後果"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"主說：我遇見以色列如葡萄在曠野；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看見你們的列祖如無花果樹上春季初熟的果子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻來到巴力‧毗珥專拜那可羞恥的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就成為可憎惡的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與他們所愛的一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於以法蓮人，他們的榮耀必如鳥飛去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不生產，不懷胎，不成孕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"縱然養大兒女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我卻必使他們喪子，甚至不留一個。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我離棄他們，他們就有禍了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看以法蓮如泰爾栽於美地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮卻要將自己的兒女帶出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"交與行殺戮的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你加給他們－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"加甚麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使他們胎墜乳乾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華審判以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：他們一切的惡事都在吉甲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在那裏憎惡他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他們所行的惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必從我地上趕出他們去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再憐愛他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的首領都是悖逆的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮受責罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"根本枯乾，必不能結果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即或生產，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必殺他們所生的愛子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["先知論以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"我的上帝必棄絕他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們不聽從他；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們也必飄流在列國中。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}